OL,3,GNEWSAOne-way plan for 'pinch point'
OL,4,Astreet in Hull
OL,5,
OL,6,FJoiner Graham Williams, 60, regularly
OL,7,Fworks in Grafton Street and said cars
OL,8,Foften mounted kerbs when passing. He
OL,9,Fadded: "I think it'll make it safer.
OL,10,FBut it won't make it any better for
OL,11,Fparking."
